{"ticker":"ASAHIINDIA","symbol":"ASAHIINDIA","instrumentId":3022804,"name":"Asahi India Glass","industry":"NSE-Auto/Truck-Original Eqp","about":"Asahi India Glass Ltd. (AIS), is India’s premier integrated glass and windows solutions provider, with a dominant presence in the automotive and building & construction sectors. AIS commands over 75% of the Indian automotive glass market and operates 13 state-of-the-art plants across the country. The company’s comprehensive product range includes clear, tinted, reflective, frosted, and lacquered glass, along with specialized services such as glass consultation and installation. AIS is a leader in promoting green buildings and sustainable living, offering cutting-edge solutions that balance daylight, energy savings, and thermal comfort. Listed on NSE and BSE, AIS is jointly promoted by the Labroo family, Asahi Glass Co. Ltd. (AGC), and Maruti Suzuki India Ltd. (MSIL).","website":"www.aisglass.com","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:04:14.594Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1192.05,"changePct":3.0026786485785886,"week52High":1192.05,"week52Low":784.4},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹30,389 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹5,609 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"122,364,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"144"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"24,906,056"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.17%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"7.73"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"40.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.09"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.99"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"2%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"55.42"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"31–87"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"8.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"19.68"},{"label":"Volume","value":"128,773"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"171,666"},{"label":"Master score","value":"76"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"87